<title>SWEDEN: SOCCER-AUSTRIA BEAT SWEDEN 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-AUSTRIA BEAT SWEDEN 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austria beat Sweden 1-0 (halftime 1-0) in a World Cup European group four qualifier on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Andreas Herzog (11th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 36,859  </p>
<p>Group four standings (tabulate under - played, won, drawn,</p>
<p>lost, goals for, against, points):</p>
<p> Sweden    3   2   0   1   7   3   6</p>
<p> Scotland  2   1   1   0   2   0   4</p>
<p> Austria   2   1   1   0   1   0   4</p>
<p> Belarus   4   1   1   2   3   7   4</p>
<p> Estonia   2   1   0   1   1   1   3</p>
<p> Latvia    3   0   1   2   2   5   1</p>
<p>Note: FIFA will decide on November 7 what action they plan</p>
<p>to take over the abandoned Estonia v Scotland match due to be</p>
<p>played today, Oct 9. That game is not included in these</p>
<p>standings.</p>
<p>Next matches: Nov 9 Austria v Latvia, Nov 10 Scotland v</p>
<p>Sweden</p>
</text>
